# DTOs go here.
#
# Two paths are open:
#
# 1. Codegen — run `openapi-generator-cli` with the Dart-Dio template
#    against `specs/openapi.yaml`. The output lands in this directory.
#    Pin the generator version in a Makefile target before the first
#    codegen run; the team has not committed to a generator yet, so this
#    directory ships empty.
#
# 2. Hand-roll — for the few DTOs a screen needs ahead of codegen, write
#    them with `freezed` + `json_serializable` and commit the `.freezed.dart`
#    / `.g.dart` outputs alongside (or `.gitignore` them and let CI
#    regenerate; the project-root `.gitignore` already excludes them).
#
# Either way: never invent fields. The wire shape lives in
# `specs/openapi.yaml`. If a screen needs a field that does not exist on
# the wire, file a spec change first.
